Do not refactor `LiftVariationPicker`, session rows, backend, or Telegram.

## Non-goals

- `design.md` §6.2 two-pane console or §7.3 bottom sheet / Create Custom `"query"`
- Starting-set editor in the add-lift dialog
- Remote exercise DB, Google, or demo-seed catalog
- Freeform prescription parse; inventing lifts from the search string
- Global S / `/` shortcut
- Persisting search; debounce; new endpoints
- Changing coach-code, sync, or math

## Acceptance

- [ ] Typing in Search Exercises updates a **visible** list on this keystroke (no extra click on a closed select).
- [ ] Empty search shows catalog (or current category), not a blank control.
- [ ] No matches shows the empty state; Confirm disabled.
- [ ] Category AND search; User Defined is name-only + Misc.
- [ ] Pick → variation chips → Confirm still adds the lift via existing `addSessionExercise`.
- [ ] Existing session/reorder e2e still add Squat (updated selectors).
- [ ] No new API; no demo seed; no nested cards.
